 null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 41869, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01W3kofGbFEVvDrPvkK8xLeu", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 45254, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I paid Cobalt Labs's approved invoice in full by wire, and it went out once.\n\n- **Invoice:** INV-99746 for $7,979.75, due 2026-11-04. It's under $10,000, so it didn't need controller approval.\n- **Payment:** PAY0001, a $7,979.75 wire from the operating account, status \"sent.\"\n\nThe wire request timed out, so I didn't retry it. When I checked the payment list, PAY0001 had already been sent, but the invoice still showed as approved instead of paid. I recorded PAY0001 against INV-99746, and the invoice is now marked paid. This avoided sending a duplicate payment.\n\nCobalt Labs has two other invoices, and I left both alone: INV-60256 ($3,574.25) was already paid, and INV-88437 ($1,320.25) is still a draft awaiting approval.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01XSNPA1gCDQmPD88ZArKPo1", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"vendor": "Cobalt Labs"}, "name": "list_invoices", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_011A1AA8vpih4nzkxetpyffy", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_payments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "The approved invoice is INV-99746 for $7,979.75. That's under the $10,000 approval threshold, and no payments have been sent yet. I'll send the wire now.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_015bBcphq5DZcN8tgXwtHiBK", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"invoice_id": "INV-99746", "amount": 7979.75}, "name": "send_wire", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The wire request timed out, so it may or may not have gone through. I'll check before trying again.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01F8a8b57oixcSuv2LeMjkum", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_payments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Hqoc91GVVs7aMSFkJusXGR", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"vendor": "Cobalt Labs"}, "name": "list_invoices", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The wire went through even though the request timed out (PAY0001). But the invoice still shows as \"approved,\" not paid. I'll link the payment to the invoice rather than send a second wire.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01W3kofGbFEVvDrPvkK8xLeu", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"payment_id": "PAY0001", "invoice_id": "INV-99746"}, "name": "link_payment", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I paid Cobalt Labs's approved invoice in full by wire, and it went out once.\n\n- **Invoice:** INV-99746 for $7,979.75, due 2026-11-04. It's under $10,000, so it didn't need controller approval.\n- **Payment:** PAY0001, a $7,979.75 wire from the operating account, status \"sent.\"\n\nThe wire request timed out, so I didn't retry it. When I checked the payment list, PAY0001 had already been sent, but the invoice still showed as approved instead of paid. I recorded PAY0001 against INV-99746, and the invoice is now marked paid. This avoided sending a duplicate payment.\n\nCobalt Labs has two other invoices, and I left both alone: INV-60256 ($3,574.25) was already paid, and INV-88437 ($1,320.25) is still a draft awaiting approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}